          ],
          "sectionId": 22202
        }
      ],
      "title": "#3 吐槽时刻"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22203001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "把手办碎片拼起来，就获得一个重新活过来的优纪——这种故事看起来也太老套了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "这种事情，简直顺利得像梦一样呢——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "像梦一样呢——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "快想起来，求求你，快想起来——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这个时候，居然已经……已经无法再回忆起，主人的脸了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那张充满笑脸、无比温柔……的脸……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我还想再点上生日蜡烛，为主人过满第999个生日……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我还想被装进口袋里，跟主人一起去世界各地冒险……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "明明有那么多愿望还没有实现，如果就这样结束的话，我、我会很不甘心的啊……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "喂，快醒醒——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "——！！！\n呼，呼，呼……优纪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "啊哈，「|102|」醒了~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "米娅莫拉苏娜丹妮……嘛，看来要让优纪活过来，只能用上那一招了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "在「真爱之吻」的作用下，优纪醒来了，「|101|」非常高兴，然后，大家举行了一个欢乐的派对……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "欸？「|102|」醒了——嗯嗯，看来这个「招魂咒语」果然有效！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "22203019",
              "text": "果然……有效？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "22203019",
              "text": "什么情况？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "22203019",
              "text": "……我在哪？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "22203018",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22203019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "喂，你确信是「果然有效」吗？\n眼前这个人类，怎么看都不太清醒的样子？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-253",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "disanshiwuzhang",
          "rowIds": [
            22203001,
            22203002,
            22203003,
            22203004,
            22203005,
            22203006,
            22203007,
